M09_Mobius_Initial_Conversation soft-lock guard. IDS_M09_D07 (900) and
IDS_M09_P01 (903) are the only gate to objective 901 and M09_Mobius_Follow;
the original handlers continue only on ACTION_COMPLETE_CONVERSATION_ENDED.
Both are key conversations, so key pre-emption ends them ENDED, but an orator
beyond the 200 m audience limit at a remark boundary ends them INTERRUPTED and
the escort can then never start. On INTERRUPTED/UNABLE_TO_INIT, resume on a
1 s timer (900 -> start P01 as the original does; 903 -> the original
hand-off), skipped if Mobius or Havoc is dead. The timer keeps a level-release
reset, which also reports INTERRUPTED, from acting on the outgoing world. The
hand-off is guarded by a saved once-flag; the ENDED path is unchanged.

